  "linkChanges": [
    {
      "name": "docs/editorial/blog-ai-agents-workflows-australia/03-articulo-ai-agents-workflows-australia.md",
      "before": "A few successful demonstrations give you less evidence than repeated checks across the kinds of cases your team handles.",
      "after": "A few successful demonstrations give you less evidence than repeated checks across the kinds of cases your team handles.\n\nFor a process you are ready to test, our guide to [building and measuring an AI workflow pilot](https://rankingrebels.com/blog/how-to-build-ai-workflow/) takes an enquiry handover through scope, review, exceptions and a decision about the next step."
    },
    {
      "name": "docs/editorial/blog-visits-few-enquiries-australia/03-articulo-visits-few-enquiries-australia.md",
      "before": "Distinguish a page's ability to generate contact from the team's ability to assess and handle it. Both matter to the eventual result, but they need different changes and measurements.",
      "after": "Distinguish a page's ability to generate contact from the team's ability to assess and handle it. Both matter to the eventual result, but they need different changes and measurements.\n\nIf you choose an AI-assisted handover, start with a [small, measured workflow pilot](https://rankingrebels.com/blog/how-to-build-ai-workflow/) so you can check the complete result and the review work it leaves for your team."
    },
    {
      "name": "docs/editorial/blog-automation-prioritisation-australia/03-articulo-automation-prioritisation-australia.md",
      "before": "Finish the assessment with a provisional decision: investigate for a small trial, improve the process first, retain a human decision, or defer. State what evidence could change it.",
      "after": "Finish the assessment with a provisional decision: investigate for a small trial, improve the process first, retain a human decision, or defer. State what evidence could change it.\n\nIf that first trial includes AI, use a [workflow pilot with defined checks and measurements](https://rankingrebels.com/blog/how-to-build-ai-workflow/) to turn the chosen process into a testable scope."
    },
    {
      "name": "docs/editorial/blog-custom-software-australia/03-articulo-custom-software-australia.md",
      "before": "Use the brief to discuss configuration, integration and custom development on comparable terms. Begin with the smallest useful scope that can test the important assumptions, and distinguish a prototype from a supported production service.",
      "after": "Use the brief to discuss configuration, integration and custom development on comparable terms. Begin with the smallest useful scope that can test the important assumptions, and distinguish a prototype from a supported production service.\n\nWhere the component uses AI to interpret information, plan a [small workflow pilot](https://rankingrebels.com/blog/how-to-build-ai-workflow/) with a defined review step and a way to verify the complete result."
    }
  ],
